    {
      "text": "churches built up to get gain or power shall be brought low, 1 Ne. 22:23. Gentiles shall stumble because they build many churches, 2 Ne. 26:20. churches built by men shall contend against each other, 2 Ne. 28:3–4. if church is called in name of man, it is church of man, 3 Ne. 27:8. those who build church upon works of men will have joy for season, then comes the end, 3 Ne. 27:11. churches built up to get gain deny true Church, 4 Ne. 1:26. many churches in land deny parts of gospel, 4 Ne. 1:27. false church multiplies because of iniquity and power of Satan, 4 Ne. 1:28. church denies Christ and persecutes true Church, 4 Ne. 1:29–30. churches will become defiled and leaders will rise up in pride, Morm. 8:28. churches will forgive sins for money, Morm. 8:32.",
